flowchart TD
    Start[Provider callback or polling result] --> Verify{Authenticity and expected provider?}
    Verify -- no --> Reject[Reject, sanitize, and audit]
    Verify -- yes --> Lookup[Find payment/order by provider reference]
    Lookup --> Tenant[Tenant context from trusted internal record]
    Tenant --> State{Valid state transition?}
    State -- no --> Conflict[Record conflict for reconciliation]
    State -- yes --> Tx[Commit idempotent status update]
    Tx --> Notify[Enqueue tenant-scoped notification or fulfillment job]
    Notify --> UI[Refresh UI through read API or realtime event]
    Tx --> Evidence[Persist provider response and correlation metadata]
    Conflict --> Evidence
    Reject --> Evidence

    Note1[Provider data never chooses the tenant database.] -.-> Tenant
    Note2[External calls remain outside database transactions.] -.-> Tx